{"id":"cruz","lemma":"cruz","pos":"noun","rank":1655,"glosses":["cross","torture; misery","tails (side of a coin)"],"ipa":"/ˈkɾuθ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cruces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cruz.wav","formAudio":{"cruces":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cruces.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Dónde está la Cruz Roja?","en":"Where's the Red Cross?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461837"},{"text":"No cruces este puente.","en":"Don't cross this bridge.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460211"},{"text":"Nos lo jugaremos a cara o cruz.","en":"We'll toss for it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448950"},{"text":"No cruces esta línea.","en":"Don't cross this line."},{"text":"La Cruz Roja distribuyó alimentos a los refugiados.","en":"The Red Cross distributed food to the refugees.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/928975"}]}